WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:02.960
(upbeat music)

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:06.556
- What's a four-letter
word for shipbuilding wood?

00:00:06.556 --> 00:00:09.716
- Uh, James, are you
sharing your sand toys?

00:00:09.716 --> 00:00:10.539
- Do you want a snack?

00:00:10.539 --> 00:00:12.449
Here, hold on, have a snack.

00:00:12.449 --> 00:00:13.159
- Thank you.

00:00:13.159 --> 00:00:15.261
- That's why I'm hungry, it's almost 4:30.

00:00:15.261 --> 00:00:16.143
Time for dinner.

00:00:16.143 --> 00:00:17.691
- James, you know what, just wait.

00:00:17.691 --> 00:00:20.391
Just wait for mommy, I'm
just going to come help you.

00:00:20.391 --> 00:00:22.698
You know, I really shouldn't
leave him like this.

00:00:23.624 --> 00:00:25.160
- Are you going to
finish this granola bar?

00:00:26.544 --> 00:00:28.725
- Einstein, physics, buddy.

00:00:28.725 --> 00:00:29.726
You're not going to be able to

00:00:29.726 --> 00:00:30.898
climb the slide at that angle.

00:00:30.898 --> 00:00:32.461
Has your tutor taught you nothing?

00:00:32.461 --> 00:00:34.129
You know what, you need
some more Omega-3s, buddy.

00:00:34.129 --> 00:00:35.701
You better come over
here and eat this salmon.

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:37.174
Your brain is starving.

00:00:37.174 --> 00:00:38.594
- Hey, check it out.

00:00:41.566 --> 00:00:44.145
Oh, hey ladies, how's the Instagrams?

00:00:44.145 --> 00:00:45.852
Oh wait, let's do something
for the Snapchat story.

00:00:45.852 --> 00:00:46.820
- Oh.

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.228
- Oh, it's not recording.

00:00:48.228 --> 00:00:49.224
- Who has time for that?

00:00:49.224 --> 00:00:50.666
I have to take Einy to ballroom dancing,

00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:51.824
and then we have Tae-Kwon-Do.

00:00:51.824 --> 00:00:54.262
I have to pick up all of the
shirts for his Mathletes team.

00:00:54.262 --> 00:00:56.864
Don't you guys have extracurricular
activities going on?

00:00:56.864 --> 00:00:58.590
- Alright, I'm gonna leave.

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:00.643
Bye, Arlo, see you in a few hours.

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:02.552
Mommy's gonna run some errands.

00:01:02.552 --> 00:01:03.649
See you guys.

00:01:03.649 --> 00:01:06.129
- I'm here! Oh! What?

00:01:07.266 --> 00:01:09.778
Hey, you guys are still here?

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:11.776
- Um, wait, where's Sarah?

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.239
- (beep) Ugh, that's why my
husband keeps calling me.

00:01:20.239 --> 00:01:22.211
Don't go anywhere, guys,
okay, we're going to play.

00:01:22.211 --> 00:01:23.618
God, get it together.

00:01:23.618 --> 00:01:25.013
That's the second time this week.

00:01:25.013 --> 00:01:26.834
Oh, God. (beep)

00:01:26.834 --> 00:01:28.994
I don't need that, don't need that.

00:01:28.994 --> 00:01:31.086
Come on, (beep), why is running so hard?

00:01:31.086 --> 00:01:32.019
I got to work out.

00:01:32.019 --> 00:01:34.296
(sign squeaking)
- Come on.

